{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18062","headline":"杂诗 · 韩愈","name":"杂诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古史散左右，诗书置後前。\n岂殊蠹书虫，生死文字间。\n古道自愚憃，古言自包缠。\n当今固殊古，谁与爲欣欢。\n独携无言子，共升崑仑颠。\n长风飘襟裾，遂起飞高圆。\n下视禹九州，一尘集豪端。\n遨嬉未云几，下已亿万年。\n向者夸夺子，万坟厌其巅。\n惜哉抱所见，白黑未及分。\n慷慨爲悲咤，泪如九河飜。\n指摘相告语，虽还今谁亲。\n翩然下大荒，被发骑骐驎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}